      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables\n    principal = 1_300_000_000\n    pre_tax_profit_rate = 0.07\n    operating_cost = 6_000_000\n    deposit_interest_rate = 0.05\n    expected_loss_rate = 0.003\n    unexpected_loss_rate = 0.08\n    risk_free_rate = 0.015\n    tax_rate = 0.25\n\n    revenue = principal * pre_tax_profit_rate\n    deposit_interest_expense = principal * deposit_interest_rate\n    expected_loss = principal * expected_loss_rate\n    capital = principal * unexpected_loss_rate\n    income_from_capital = capital * risk_free_rate\n\n    pre_tax_risk_adjusted_income = (\n        revenue\n        - operating_cost\n        - deposit_interest_expense\n        - expected_loss\n        + income_from_capital\n    )\n\n    after_tax_risk_adjusted_income = pre_tax_risk_adjusted_income * (1 - tax_rate)\n    raroc = after_tax_risk_adjusted_income / capital\n\n    # Return RAROC as a percentage rounded to three decimal places\n    return round(raroc * 100, 3)\n```",
